          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the passage of a bright point following a straight trajectory then with jerky movements: observation of the passage of the ISS with autokinetic illusion.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "cfb04d35f1b8eb0654f78d8ed4bfba620890a1e73d99536ae3a1e414a6574156"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
